 gie pursued stand-up comedy when she realized it’s a lot more fun than 
 ‘book club’. Her deadpan style and sarcastic storytelling about marria
 ge\, motherhood and mammograms has won over audiences of all ages. Maggie 
 has 150k+ social followers\, 30M+ views on Instagram & TikTok\, with severa
 l viral clips landing her on Inside Edition\, Yahoo News\, The New York Po
 st\, Daily Mail\, Business Insider & Fox News. Maggie performs regularly a
 t Zanies Chicago where she SOLD OUT 4 shows in May 2026. She also performe
 d on Nateland’s “The Showcase\, Season 3”. Maggie is the first femal
 e comedian to feature on Nate Bargatze’s Arena tour. She is also the co-
 founder of ALL THAT GOOD STUFF\, a comedy showcase and production company.
